        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDS425, Solid Brass Baseboard Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom high-end residences to large commercial projects, this simple door stop is sure to get the job done. The 4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. Two tips are included with each door stop: a white one and a grey one. It is made out of solid brass and is available an array of great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDS425-specifications.gif?v=1704354640\" width\"589\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Solid Brass 3-1/4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-3-8-inch-short-baseboard-door-stop-deltana-bds125\"><b>1 1/2 inch baseboard door stop</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-1-4-inch-baseboard-door-bumper-deltana-bds30\"><b>3 1/4 inch  baseboard door stop</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-baseboard-door-bumper\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BDS425 Long Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tips: White and Gray Tips included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BDS425.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  BDS425 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper",
                "description": "Solid Brass Baseboard Door Stop, Deltana BDS425 - From high-end residences to large commercial projects, this simple door stop is sure to get the job done. The 4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. Two tips are included with each door stop: a white one and a grey one. It is made out of solid brass and is available in great finishes.",
